.Dd $Mdocdate: November 24 2026 $
.Dt ANSILOVE_XBIN 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ansilove_xbin
.Nd Process and render XBin content
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In ansilove.h
.Ft int
.Fn ansilove_xbin "struct ansilove_ctx *ctx" "struct ansilove_options *options"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn ansilove_xbin
function renders XBin data from
.Va ctx->buffer ,
using
.Va ctx->length
bytes of input and the settings in
.Fa options .
Initialize both structures with
.Xr ansilove_init 3
and load the input with
.Xr ansilove_loadfile 3
before calling this function.
.Pp
On success,
.Va ctx->png.buffer
contains the encoded PNG image and
.Va ctx->png.length
contains its size in bytes.
Use
.Xr ansilove_savefile 3
to write the image to disk, or read the PNG buffer directly.
The buffer belongs to the context and is released by
.Xr ansilove_clean 3 .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The
.Fn ansilove_xbin
function returns 0 on success and \-1 on failure.
On failure, if
.Fa ctx
is not
.Dv NULL ,
.Va ctx->error
is set to an error code described in
.Xr ansilove_error 3 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ansilove_ansi 3 ,
.Xr ansilove_artworx 3 ,
.Xr ansilove_binary 3 ,
.Xr ansilove_icedraw 3 ,
.Xr ansilove_pcboard 3 ,
.Xr ansilove_tundra 3 ,
.Xr libansilove 3
